# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Blacksmithing --out` from Forever's client tables. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/blacksmithing
title Blacksmithing 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Data:
# The Forever client's tables (recipes, skill thresholds, reagents, vendor
# prices) via wago.tools, with Classic Era filling the few spells and items
# they lack; pfQuest (vendors, drops, nodes) and a curated trainer list
# checked against npcs.json. Forever changed many thresholds, reagents and
# names from Classic, so Classic recipe tables do not apply.
#
# Trainers and vendors are smart targets: the engine sends each character to
# the nearest one of its faction. Farming spots are picked per faction.
#
# Recipe choice: cheapest expected cost to 300 (Classic skill-up chances:
# certain while orange, falling from yellow to grey), with gathered materials
# valued at 4x their vendor sell price; see tools/lib/professions/plan.js.
# Material counts are expected values; yellow and green crafts can take more.
#
# Route:
#     1-45  Rough Sharpening Stone (about 68)
#    45-75  Rough Grinding Stone (about 54)
#    75-83  Rough Grinding Stone (about 58)
#    83-100 Runed Copper Belt (about 21)
#   100-112 Heavy Weightstone (about 23)
#   112-121 Rough Bronze Leggings (about 9)
#   121-150 Patterned Bronze Bracers (about 56)
#   150-155 Silvered Bronze Gauntlets (about 9)
#   155-175 Bronze Warhammer (about 32)
#   175-185 Solid Sharpening Stone (about 30)
#   185-200 Golden Scale Bracers (about 23)
#   200-210 Steel Breastplate (about 13)
#   210-225 Steel Plate Helm (about 27)
#   225-230 Mithril Coif (about 6)
#   230-235 Dense Weightstone (about 12)
#   235-244 Heavy Mithril Boots (about 18)
#   244-268 Sentinel's Sabatons (about 26)
#   268-300 Huge Thorium Battleaxe (about 51)

step Apprentice Blacksmithing
  tip Blacksmithing runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 17s in all.
  train Blacksmithing Apprentice
  skill Blacksmithing 1

